meta {
  name: 00 Setup
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Run this folder first (or "Run Collection"). It signs in as an admin and as a
  non-admin and stashes, as runtime variables:

    sessionAdmin / csrfAdmin   - admin PHPSESSID cookie + CSRF token
    sessionUser  / csrfUser    - non-admin PHPSESSID cookie + CSRF token

  Every later request sets its identity with an explicit `Cookie` header built
  from these. Re-run this folder if the variables get cleared or a run 401s.

  Requires `php bruno/seed-users.php` to have been run.
}
